<a:Comment>Project administration is the process of managing a project by overseeing its scope, tracking milestones to ensure progress, and managing the project budget to control costs. It involves coordinating tasks and resources to achieve the project&#39;s objectives within the defined timeframe and budget.</a:Comment>
