<o:LogicalDiagram Id="o53">
<a:ObjectID>5A31C046-8C3F-4F69-9D42-C112F6A20CF5</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Lease_Contract_Premise</a:Name>
<a:Code>CONTRACT_USE</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1681867149</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Aled.Lewis</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1702990786</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Aled.Lewis</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>This diagram illustrates where LEASE_CONTRACTs can be applied, in other words what can be leased.
In addition this diagram shows that DOCUMENTS associated with LEASE_CONTRACTs can be stored in the solution.
LEGAL_ENTITY is also shown here; being associated with SITE.
This is a different use to the LEGAL_ENTITY which is associated with the CONTRACT. This relationship is mastered in the Real Estate MAGMA.Location solution and is only used for Property Management.
Technically this solution should not be in Tango but as it is it is contaned here.</a:Comment>
