<a:Comment>Each Vendor can exist in 3 ERPs.
Each ERP is the master source for its ERP specific version of the Vendor and each will have an ERP specific unique ID. 
All Costs for a Vendor must be submitted to the ERP which mastered the specific Vendor version.</a:Comment>
