<a:ModificationDate>1744360917</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Nagavalli.Vinnakota</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Lease contract payments may need Tax to be paid on top of them. Tax is set at the Legal Entity level and differs per country.
There can be more than one Tax for each payment for a vendor.
There can also be more than one type of Taxes for each payment. 
</a:Comment>
