<a:Modifier>Nagavalli.Vinnakota</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The kind of payment that is arranged between Shell and the Partners.
These are also known as Conditions.
Costs lay out what will be paid, when, how, where to etc.
The individual payment line Items (Payment_Tokens) are calculated using the infromation defined in the Cost.</a:Comment>
